#====================accounts=====================

#api call for register
###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/accounts/register/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username":"django",
    "email":"django@gmail.com",
    "password":"password@123",
    "phone":"987456635",
    "dob":"2026-10-27"
}


#===================expense=======================
#api call for listing expenses
###
GET  http://127.0.0.1:8000/expenses/
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Basic django:password@123


#api call for creating expense
###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/expenses/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic django:password@123

{
    "title":"biriyani",
    "amount":200
}